# w3-b — the interleaved wand (mirrors demos/11-noita/w3-modifier-chain.bqn, the interleaved section)
# Wand [DP, Triple, SB, DP, SB, SB]: one block; the shortcut dies here, the general binding is the evaluator.
# binds: the order-derived srel — fiber of each projectile = the modifiers whose next-projectile-at-or-after
# lands on it (the .bqn's NextP, inverted). Geometry from the slot ground, listed the way moore is.
n 7
col keys num 0 1 2 3 4 5 6
col wand bool 1 0 0 0 0 0 0
col spell bool 0 1 1 1 1 1 1
col slot num -1 0 1 2 3 4 5
col proj bool 0 0 0 1 0 1 1
col mod bool 0 1 0 0 1 0 0
col multi bool 0 0 1 0 0 0 0
col drawAdd num 0 1 3 0 1 0 0
col damage num 0 0 0 3 0 3 3
col bal num 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
col minBal num 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
col member bool 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
bind deck mask 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
srel binds | | | 1 | | 4 |
ja 杖 wand
ja 呪文 spell
ja 枠 slot
ja 投射 proj
ja 改 mod
ja 抜追加 drawAdd
ja 損傷 damage
ja 残高 bal
ja 最低残高 minBal
ja 成員 member
ja 山札 deck
ja 束縛群 binds
ja 前 prev
ja 行 row
ja 番号 index
ja 字 char
